---
export const homeFaqs = [
  {
    question: 'What is Instanten and is it completely free to use?',
    answer:
      'Yes — Instanten is a free, browser-based platform combining fast everyday utilities and practical tutorials. You can use every page with zero registration, subscriptions, or hidden limits.',
  },
  {
    question: 'How do I use an Instanten tool without creating an account?',
    answer:
      'Simply open any Instanten tool from the homepage or navigation bar, enter your input, and copy the result immediately — no login or email verification is ever required.',
  },
  {
    question: 'What types of workflows are included in Instanten tools?',
    answer:
      'Instanten tools cover everyday formatting, quick calculations, developer and creator utilities, and practical workflow helpers paired with clear step-by-step documentation.',
  },
  {
    question: 'How does Instanten provide instant help for daily tasks?',
    answer:
      'Alongside one-click browser utilities, Instanten publishes concise troubleshooting steps, examples, and Blog guides so you get immediate answers without digging through long forums.',
  },
  {
    question: 'Can I open every instant tool on mobile as well as desktop?',
    answer:
      'Yes. Every instant tool on Instanten uses a responsive layout built for Android phones, iPhones, iPads, Macs, and Windows PCs, including full Light and Dark Mode support.',
  },
  {
    question: 'Why choose browser-based instant tools instead of downloading apps?',
    answer:
      'Browser-based instant tools start immediately, take zero device storage, require no permissions, and stay updated automatically across all your devices.',
  },
  {
    question: 'Does Instanten work as an instant online platform in any browser?',
    answer:
      'Yes — Instanten runs directly in Chrome, Safari, Firefox, Edge, and Brave as an instant online web application with fast static page delivery.',
  },
  {
    question: 'How accurate and fast are instant convert workflows on Instanten?',
    answer:
      'Instant convert operations execute in milliseconds inside your browser using standard formulas and clean formatting rules, giving you reliable copy-paste output right away.',
  },
];
---

<div class="ffa-seo-wrapper">
  <section class="ffa-band ffa-band--canvas">
    <div class="ffa-container-wide">
      <h2 class="ffa-h2-lg">How Instanten works</h2>
      <div class="ffa-grid-3">
        <div class="ffa-card">
          <p class="ffa-step-num">01</p>
          <h3 class="ffa-h3-card">Pick an Instanten tool</h3>
          <p class="ffa-card-body">
            Open any utility right from the homepage with zero account creation, zero extensions, and zero waiting. Every tool loads directly inside your browser on phone, tablet, or desktop.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="ffa-card">
          <p class="ffa-step-num">02</p>
          <h3 class="ffa-h3-card">Run or instant convert live</h3>
          <p class="ffa-card-body">
            Paste your text, values, or parameters and see clean output in milliseconds. Whether you need an instant convert step, quick formatting, or structured calculations, results update live as you work.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="ffa-card">
          <p class="ffa-step-num">03</p>
          <h3 class="ffa-h3-card">Copy results &amp; get instant help</h3>
          <p class="ffa-card-body">
            Copy accurate results in one click or jump straight into a clear step-by-step guide whenever you need extra context, formulas, or troubleshooting tips.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ffa-band ffa-band--soft">
    <div class="ffa-container-wide">
      <h2 class="ffa-h2-lg">Built to be trusted, not just fast</h2>
      <p class="ffa-lead">
        Most utility sites bury simple ten-second tasks behind pop-ups, heavy scripts, and login walls. Instanten keeps every workflow clean, transparent, and distraction-free.
      </p>
      <div class="ffa-grid-2">
        <div class="ffa-card">
          <h3 class="ffa-h3-card">Zero sign-up instant help</h3>
          <p class="ffa-card-body">
            Every utility and guide opens ready to work. You never hand over an email address, start a trial, or create a password just to solve a quick daily task.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="ffa-card">
          <h3 class="ffa-h3-card">Fast instant online delivery</h3>
          <p class="ffa-card-body">
            Pages are statically pre-rendered with minimal scripts, so each instant tool responds immediately even on mobile data connections or older laptops.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="ffa-card">
          <h3 class="ffa-h3-card">Verified instant convert accuracy</h3>
          <p class="ffa-card-body">
            From unit, format, and data transformations to developer and creator helpers, outputs follow standard rules in copy-ready format.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="ffa-card">
          <h3 class="ffa-h3-card">Browser-first privacy</h3>
          <p class="ffa-card-body">
            Processing runs inside your browser session whenever possible, and theme settings stay in local storage on your own device.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ffa-band ffa-band--soft ffa-band--border-top">
    <div class="ffa-container-prose">
      <h2 class="ffa-h2-lg">Instanten, explained</h2>
      <p class="ffa-lead">
        How our instant tools work, what you can accomplish in seconds, and why fast browser utilities beat bulky downloads.
      </p>

      <div class="ffa-prose-block">
        <h3 class="ffa-h3-prose">What Instanten does</h3>
        <p class="ffa-p">
          Every day, students, developers, writers, designers, and teams run into dozens of small digital tasks — formatting data, running an <strong>instant convert</strong> check, cleaning text, calculating values, or looking up technical answers. Opening heavy desktop software for a thirty-second job wastes momentum, while random search results often lead to cluttered screens full of intrusive banners and broken buttons.
        </p>
        <p class="ffa-p">
          <strong>Instanten</strong> solves that problem in one clean place. Built as a fast, modern hub of free <strong>instant tools</strong> and practical tutorials, <strong>Instanten</strong> brings everyday utilities and clear explanations together inside a lightweight <strong>instant online</strong> workspace — with no account, no usage cap, and no paywall standing in front of your answer.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="ffa-prose-block">
        <h3 class="ffa-h3-prose">Why an Instanten tool feels effortless</h3>
        <p class="ffa-p">
          Speed alone is only half the job; clarity matters just as much. Every <strong>Instanten tool</strong> puts input and output front and center with touch-friendly mobile controls, clean keyboard navigation on desktop, and instant Light and Dark Mode switching that remembers your preference across pages.
        </p>
        <p class="ffa-p">
          Three engineering rules guide the entire <strong>Instanten tools</strong> library:
        </p>
        <ul class="ffa-dot-list">
          <li>
            <span class="ffa-dot"></span>
            <span><strong>Instant startup with zero bloat</strong> — static HTML pages load almost immediately across Chrome, Safari, Firefox, and Edge.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ffa-dot"></span>
            <span><strong>Copy-ready, standards-based output</strong> — whether you run an instant convert utility or a formatting helper, results paste cleanly into code, docs, or spreadsheets.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ffa-dot"></span>
            <span><strong>Practical context right beside the tool</strong> — our guides explain edge cases and best practices so you get genuine <strong>instant help</strong>, not just raw numbers.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="ffa-prose-block">
        <h3 class="ffa-h3-prose">Everyday tasks you can finish with Instanten tools</h3>
        <ul class="ffa-dot-list">
          <li>
            <span class="ffa-dot"></span>
            <span><strong>Fast formatting and instant convert tasks</strong> — transform units, structured text, code snippets, or document values without manual math mistakes.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ffa-dot"></span>
            <span><strong>Developer and creator workflows</strong> — clean, inspect, validate, and prepare assets faster during coding sprints, publishing, or design handoffs.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ffa-dot"></span>
            <span><strong>Student and office instant help</strong> — verify calculations, check references, and follow step-by-step walkthroughs on any phone, Chromebook, or PC.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ffa-dot"></span>
            <span><strong>Actionable AI and productivity guides</strong> — read our <a href="/blog" class="ffa-inline-link">Instanten Blog</a> for practical tutorials on modern tools, smart workflows, and browser-based efficiency.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="ffa-prose-block">
        <h3 class="ffa-h3-prose">Why instant online tools beat heavy installers</h3>
        <p class="ffa-p">
          Native desktop suites make sense for multi-gigabyte video rendering, not quick daily utilities. Running an <strong>instant online</strong> toolkit directly in your browser removes OS compatibility headaches, storage bloat, background updaters, and license prompts — the exact same <strong>instant tool</strong> works identically on Windows, macOS, Linux, Android, and iOS. Learn more about our philosophy on the <a href="/about" class="ffa-inline-link">About page</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="ffa-prose-block">
        <h3 class="ffa-h3-prose">How to get the best results on Instanten</h3>
        <ul class="ffa-dot-list">
          <li>
            <span class="ffa-dot"></span>
            <span><strong>Bookmark the homepage for one-tap access.</strong> Pin Instanten to your browser bar or mobile home screen so every instant tool is always one tap away during busy work sessions.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ffa-dot"></span>
            <span><strong>Use clean, plain input first.</strong> Paste unformatted values when running an instant convert check so hidden spaces or rich-text characters never interfere with your output.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ffa-dot"></span>
            <span><strong>Pair utilities with worked examples.</strong> Whenever a task involves unfamiliar rules or edge cases, open our <a href="/blog" class="ffa-inline-link">Blog guides</a> for practical walkthroughs and ready-to-use examples.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ffa-dot"></span>
            <span><strong>Switch themes for long reading sessions.</strong> Toggle between crisp Light Mode and low-glare Dark Mode from the top header pill or slide-out menu at any time.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ffa-dot"></span>
            <span><strong>Share direct page links with teammates.</strong> Every guide and utility on Instanten uses a clean, permanent URL with full Open Graph preview cards for effortless sharing on Slack, WhatsApp, X, or email.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="ffa-dot"></span>
            <span><strong>Suggest the next feature you need.</strong> Missing a specific instant convert helper or workflow guide? Visit our <a href="/contact" class="ffa-inline-link">Contact page</a> and tell us what would save you time next.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ffa-band ffa-band--canvas" id="faq">
    <div class="ffa-container-wide">
      <h2 class="ffa-h2-lg">Frequently asked questions</h2>
      <div class="ffa-faq-list">
        {homeFaqs.map((item) => (
          <details class="ffa-faq-item">
            <summary class="ffa-faq-summary">
              <span>{item.question}</span>
              <svg class="ffa-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke-linecap="round" />
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <p class="ffa-faq-answer">{item.answer}</p>
          </details>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<style is:global>
  .ffa-seo-wrapper {
    font-family: "Inter", "DM Sans", system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
    border-top: 1px solid #ebebeb;
  }
  :is(html.dark, body.dark, [data-theme="dark"], [data-scheme="dark"]) .ffa-seo-wrapper {
    border-top-color: #2a2a2a;
  }
  .ffa-band {
    padding: 72px 24px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .ffa-band { padding: 52px 20px; }
  }
  .ffa-band--canvas { background-color: #ffffff; }
  .ffa-band--soft { background-color: #fafafa; }
  .ffa-band--border-top { border-top: 1px solid #ebebeb; }
  :is(html.dark, body.dark, [data-theme="dark"], [data-scheme="dark"]) .ffa-band--canvas { background-color: #1c1c1c; }
  :is(html.dark, body.dark, [data-theme="dark"], [data-scheme="dark"]) .ffa-band--soft { background-color: #141414; }
  :is(html.dark, body.dark, [data-theme="dark"], [data-scheme="dark"]) .ffa-band--border-top { border-top-color: #262626; }
  .ffa-container-wide { max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; }
  #faq .ffa-container-wide { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .ffa-container-prose { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .ffa-h2-lg {
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3.2vw, 32px);
    font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.2; color: #171717; margin: 0;
  }
  .ffa-lead {
    margin: 12px 0 0; max-width: 660px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; color: #4d4d4d;
  }
  .ffa-grid-3 {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 36px;
  }
  .ffa-grid-2 {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 36px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .ffa-grid-3 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .ffa-grid-2 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .ffa-card {
    border: 1px solid #ebebeb; border-radius: 10px; background-color: #ffffff;
    padding: 24px; box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
  }
  .ffa-step-num {
    font-family: "JetBrains Mono", ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 12px; color: #888888; margin: 0 0 10px;
  }
  .ffa-h3-card { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #171717; margin: 0; }
  .ffa-card-body { margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.65; color: #4d4d4d; }
  .ffa-prose-block { margin-top: 40px; }
  .ffa-h3-prose { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.025em; color: #171717; margin: 0; }
  .ffa-p { margin: 14px 0 0; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.75; color: #4d4d4d; }
  .ffa-p strong, .ffa-dot-list strong { color: #171717; font-weight: 600; }
  .ffa-dot-list { list-style: none; margin: 16px 0 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
  .ffa-dot-list li { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: #4d4d4d; }
  .ffa-dot { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: #a1a1a1; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 10px; }
  .ffa-inline-link { color: #0070f3; text-decoration: none; }
  .ffa-inline-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

  /* FAQ Accordion */
  .ffa-faq-list { margin-top: 32px; max-width: 760px; border-top: 1px solid #ebebeb; border-bottom: 1px solid #ebebeb; }
  .ffa-faq-item { border-bottom: 1px solid #ebebeb; padding: 18px 0; }
  .ffa-faq-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .ffa-faq-summary { list-style: none; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.45; color: #171717; }
  .ffa-faq-summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .ffa-faq-icon { width: 20px; height: 20px; flex-shrink: 0; color: #888888; transition: transform 0.2s ease; }
  .ffa-faq-item[open] .ffa-faq-icon { transform: rotate(45deg); }
  .ffa-faq-answer { margin: 12px 0 0; max-width: 680px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #4d4d4d; }

  /* Dark Mode */
  :is(html.dark, body.dark, [data-theme="dark"], [data-scheme="dark"]) .ffa-h2-lg,
  :is(html.dark, body.dark, [data-theme="dark"], [data-scheme="dark"]) .ffa-h3-card,
  :is(html.dark, body.dark, [data-theme="dark"], [data-scheme="dark"]) .ffa-h3-prose,
  :is(html.dark, body.dark, [data-theme="dark"], [data-scheme="dark"]) .ffa-p strong,
  :is(html.dark, body.dark, [data-theme="dark"], [data-scheme="dark"]) .ffa-dot-list strong,
  :is(html.dark, body.dark, [data-theme="dark"], [data-scheme="dark"]) .ffa-faq-summary { color: #ededed; }
  :is(html.dark, body.dark, [data-theme="dark"], [data-scheme="dark"]) .ffa-lead,
  :is(html.dark, body.dark, [data-theme="dark"], [data-scheme="dark"]) .ffa-card-body,
  :is(html.dark, body.dark, [data-theme="dark"], [data-scheme="dark"]) .ffa-p,
  :is(html.dark, body.dark, [data-theme="dark"], [data-scheme="dark"]) .ffa-dot-list li,
  :is(html.dark, body.dark, [data-theme="dark"], [data-scheme="dark"]) .ffa-faq-answer { color: #a1a1a1; }
  :is(html.dark, body.dark, [data-theme="dark"], [data-scheme="dark"]) .ffa-card { background-color: #1c1c1c; border-color: #2a2a2a; }
  :is(html.dark, body.dark, [data-theme="dark"], [data-scheme="dark"]) .ffa-faq-list,
  :is(html.dark, body.dark, [data-theme="dark"], [data-scheme="dark"]) .ffa-faq-item { border-color: #2a2a2a; }
  :is(html.dark, body.dark, [data-theme="dark"], [data-scheme="dark"]) .ffa-dot { background-color: #5a5a5a; }
  :is(html.dark, body.dark, [data-theme="dark"], [data-scheme="dark"]) .ffa-inline-link { color: #3b9eff; }
</style>
